    },
    "会删除所有账单、预算和「没花钱」确认，分类与账户保留。此操作无法撤销，建议先导出一份备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes all records, budgets and no-spend confirmations. Categories and accounts stay. This can't be undone — export a backup first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会用备份里的内容替换当前所有记录、预算和「没花钱」确认。建议先导出一份当前备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Replaces all current records, budgets and no-spend confirmations with the backup. Export a copy of the current state first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
